submit hot 1 0 2 2: write 67+3 io106, fsync io107
submit hot 2 0 1 3: write 70+2 io108
recover open: LSNs [1 3], durable 3
index: 2 blocks, every block reads back, oracle: index at LSN 3 differs from the oracle's: chunk 1 block 0 missing, want v2 at 68 (2 blocks differ)
  chunk 0 block 0 v1 pool 1 at 66
  chunk 2 block 0 v3 pool 1 at 71
